==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Deploy Limit}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Duche]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**30 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is a basic Alien stage before you hit the base, and a Traitless stage when you do. The presence of R.Ost means you're going to need to use meatshields, so be careful with how you do the Alien phase of the stage. [[Soap Cat]] and [[Seafarer Cat]] can stall the Alien Enemies for insane amounts of time, while you build up cash. Once you're done, send out something to kill the Aliens like [[Fishman Cat]] and hit the base.

The R.Ost isn't actually too magnified here, only being 200%. As a result, a high level [[Haniwa Cat]] or [[Brainwashed Eraser Cat]] can tank R.Ost for high periods of time, while [[Hitman Cat]] and [[Dogumaru (Special Cat)|Doguemon]]/[[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Jagando]] wipe R. Ost out of existence.

===Recommended Ubers===
*Since the anti-Alien phase isn't hard, use anti-Traitless ubers like any EPICFEST unit, [[Trixi the Revenant]], or [[Issun Boshi (Uber Rare Cat)|Oni Landshaker Kozuchimaru]]. to kill R.Ost quickly.

